{
    "title": "Manticore - Remnants",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_eclipse) == 2",
    "variables": [
        {
            "name": "logs",
            "value": "0"
        }
    ],
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE - ACT IV",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号 - 第四幕"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 14 - Remnants",
                "zh": "第十四章 - 残党"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Eclipse's prisoner list is old, but one entry is fresh. A transport left the Eye an hour ago, bound for the Vortex Core. Its manifest lists 'H. Snocom, pilot'.",
                        "zh": "日蚀的俘虏名单很旧，但有一条是新的。一艘运输船一小时前离开漩涡之眼，前往漩涡核心。它的货单上写着“H. 斯诺科姆，飞行员”。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "She's alive. After all these years. Commander, please.",
                        "zh": "她还活着。这么多年了。指挥官，求你了。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Indigo Brink's remnants are rallying under a Vossk boarder called T'Hebuk. Catch that transport before it reaches them. Disable it, don't destroy it.",
                        "zh": "靛蓝深渊的残党正聚集在一个叫提赫布克的沃斯克登舰兵手下。在运输船跟他们会合之前截住它。击瘫它，别打爆它。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "remnants_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:the_eye"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:the_eye",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fly to the Eye in the Rigant Vortex.",
                "zh": "飞往瑞甘特漩涡的漩涡之眼。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
            "text": {
                "en": "The transport's escort spotted you. Clear them out, then I'll guide you to the transport.",
                "zh": "运输船的护航发现你了。先清掉他们，我再引导你去找运输船。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:the_eye",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Remnant Escort",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 54,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 9,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Destroy the transport's escort.",
                "zh": "消灭运输船的护航。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "pirate Transport Pilot",
            "text": {
                "en": "Scuttle charges armed! If I can't deliver the prisoners, nobody gets them!",
                "zh": "自毁装置已启动！我送不到犯人，谁也别想要！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
            "text": {
                "en": "He blew the engines, not the hull. It's a drifting wreck now. Hack its log before the core cooks off.",
                "zh": "他炸的是引擎，不是船体。它现在是个漂流的残骸。赶在核心过热之前破解它的日志。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wreck",
            "race": "pirate",
            "name": "Prison Transport",
            "at": "2000 1000 34000"
        },
        {
            "type": "on",
            "trigger": "hacked",
            "steps": [
                {
                    "type": "set",
                    "variable": "logs",
                    "value": "1"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "timer",
            "seconds": 120,
            "label": {
                "en": "Core overload",
                "zh": "核心过载"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:the_eye",
            "text": {
                "en": "Hack the prison transport's log within 2 minutes.",
                "zh": "在2分钟内破解囚犯运输船的日志。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "logs > 0",
            "timeout": 120
        },
        {
            "type": "timer",
            "stop": true
        },
        {
            "type": "if",
            "condition": "logs < 1",
            "then": [
                {
                    "type": "fail",
                    "title": {
                        "en": "The transport's core blew. The log is lost.",
                        "zh": "运输船的核心爆炸了，日志丢失。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
            "text": {
                "en": "Got it. The prisoners were already moved. They're at Blackwell Hold, deep in the Vortex Core. The jump route runs through the Remnant Yard.",
                "zh": "拿到了。犯人已经被转移走了。他们在黑井监狱，漩涡核心深处。跃迁航线要经过残党船坞。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:the_eye",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 26000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Transport log recovered",
                "zh": "运输船日志已取回"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "log_recovered"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Return to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "返回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "Khador",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The Vortex Core is where the anomaly is strongest. Ordinary jump drives scatter there. I can tune the Manticore's drive. It will take one long night.",
                        "zh": "漩涡核心是异常最强的地方。普通的跃迁引擎到了那里会失控。我可以校准蝎尾狮号的引擎。需要一整夜。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Then you have one night, Khador. And you, ace, get some sleep.",
                        "zh": "那你就有一夜的时间，卡多尔。王牌，你去睡一觉。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 10000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Chapter 14 complete",
                "zh": "第十四章 完成"
            }
        }
    ]
}
